="00:22.490" end="00:22.760">And </span><span begin="00:22.760" end="00:23.030">I </span><span begin="00:23.030" end="00:23.360">won't </span><span begin="00:23.360" end="00:23.750">be </span><span begin="00:23.750" end="00:24.050">the </span><span begin="00:24.050" end="00:24.740">one </span><span begin="00:24.740" end="00:25.370">to </span><span begin="00:25.370" end="00:25.940">keep </span><span begin="00:25.940" end="00:26.420">you </span><span begin="00:26.420" end="00:27.710">sane</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.100" end="00:35.480"><span begin="00:28.100" end="00:28.400">And </span><span begin="00:28.400" end="00:28.700">I </span><span begin="00:28.700" end="00:29.000">won't </span><span begin="00:29.000" end="00:29.390">be </span><span begin="00:29.390" end="00:29.600">the </span><span begin="00:29.600" end="00:30.410">one </span><span begin="00:30.410" end="00:30.980">who </span><span begin="00:30.980" end="00:31.700">stays </span><span begin="00:31.700" end="00:32.000">the </span><span begin="00:32.000" end="00:35.480">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.510" end="00:36.980"><span begin="00:35.510" end="00:35.720">You </span><span begin="00:35.720" end="00:35.990">got </span><span begin="00:35.990" end="00:36.050">a </span><span begin="00:36.050" end="00:36.320">lot </span><span begin="00:36.320" end="00:36.410">of </span><span begin="00:36.410" end="00:36.680">nerve </span><span begin="00:36.680" end="00:36.980">and</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.980" end="00:38.300"><span begin="00:36.980" end="00:37.190">Looks </span><span begin="00:37.190" end="00:37.340">like </span><span begin="00:37.340" end="00:37.460">the </span><span begin="00:37.460" end="00:37.850">table's </span><span begin="00:37.850" end="00:38.300">turning</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.420" end="00:41.060"><span begin="00:38.420" end="00:38.570">And </span><span begin="00:38.570" end="00:38.720">now </span><span begin="00:38.720" end="00:38.870">you're </span><span begin="00:38.870" end="00:39.230">wishing </span><span begin="00:39.230" end="00:39.410">me </span><span begin="00:39.410" end="00:39.770">well </span><span begin="00:39.770" end="00:40.100">like </span><span begin="00:40.100" end="00:40.340">you </span><span begin="00:40.340" end="00:40.670">miss </span><span begin="00:40.670" end="00:41.060">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.120" end="00:42.620"><span begin="00:41.120" end="00:41.390">You've </span><span begin="00:41.390" end="00:41.630">got </span><span begin="00:41.630" end="00:41.690">a </span><span begin="00:41.690" end="00:42.050">dirty </span><span begin="00:42.050" end="00:42.350">tongue </span><span begin="00:42.350" end="00:42.620">and</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.620" end="00:44.810"><span begin="00:42.620" end="00:42.830">Looks </span><span begin="00:42.830" end="00:42.980">like </span><span begin="00:42.980" end="00:43.100">the </span><span begin="00:43.100" end="00:43.520">damage </span><span begin="00:43.520" end="00:43.730">done </span><span begin="00:43.730" end="00:43.970">is </span><span begin="00:43.970" end="00:44.600">forever </span><span begin="00:44.600" end="00:44.810">and</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.810" end="00:46.640"><span begin="00:44.810" end="00:44.990">It's </span><span begin="00:44.990" end="00:45.080">a </span><span begin="00:45.080" end="00:45.440">long </span><span begin="00:45.440" end="00:45.800">time </span><span begin="00:45.800" end="00:45.950">to </span><span begin="00:45.950" end="00:46.280">miss </span><span begin="00:46.280" end="00:46.640">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.640" end="00:50.150"><span begin="00:46.640" end="00:48.860">Whoa </span><span begin="00:48.860" end="00:50.150">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.150" end="00:52.280"><span begin="00:50.150" end="00:50.300">And </span><span begin="00:50.300" end="00:50.630">it's </span><span begin="00:50.630" end="00:50.750">a </span><span begin="00:50.750" end="00:51.080">long </span><span begin="00:51.080" end="00:51.500">time </span><span begin="00:51.500" end="00:51.620">to </span><span begin="00:51.620" end="00:51.980">miss </span><span begin="00:51.980" end="00:52.280">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.280" end="00:55.790"><span begin="00:52.280" end="00:54.350">Whoa </span><span begin="00:54.350" end="00:55.790">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.590" end="01:06.020"><span begin="01:00.590" end="01:01.430">Lonely </span><span begin="01:01.430" end="01:01.820">girl</span><span begin="01:01.820" end="01:01.880">, </span><span begin="01:01.880" end="01:02.180">it </span><span begin="01:02.180" end="01:02.570">looks </span><span begin="01:02.570" end="01:02.960">like </span><span begin="01:02.960" end="01:03.350">you </span><span begin="01:03.350" end="01:03.620">are </span><span begin="01:03.620" end="01:04.340">out </span><span begin="01:04.340" end="01:04.910">of </span><span begin="01:04.910" end="01:06.020">luck</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.290" end="01:10.580"><span begin="01:06.290" end="01:06.770">Tell </span><span begin="01:06.770" end="01:07.070">me </span><span begin="01:07.070" end="01:07.370">how </span><span begin="01:07.370" end="01:07.610">it </span><span begin="01:07.610" end="01:08.210">feels </span><span begin="01:08.210" end="01:08.360">to </span><span begin="01:08.360" end="01:08.780">watch </span><span begin="01:08.780" end="01:08.990">your </span><span begin="01:08.990" end="01:09.620">friends </span><span begin="01:09.620" end="01:10.070">give </span><span begin="01:10.070" end="01:10.580">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.640" end="01:15.710"><span begin="01:10.640" end="01:11.030">I </span><span begin="01:11.030" end="01:11.420">was </span><span begin="01:11.420" end="01:11.630">on </span><span begin="01:11.630" end="01:11.930">your </span><span begin="01:11.930" end="01:12.770">side</span><span begin="01:12.770" end="01:12.800">, </span><